OL,3,CThird person arrested after man
OL,4,Cstabbed to death in Stoke-on-Trent
OL,6,FA third man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Ffatal stabbing in Shelton, Stoke-on-
OL,8,FTrent.
OL,10,FPolice were called at 7.40pm on
OL,11,FThursday (23 July) to Ridgway Road
OL,12,Ffollowing reports that a man had been
OL,13,Fstabbed.
OL,15,FThe victim, a man in his 40s, was
OL,16,Ffound by members of the public, who
OL,17,Fcontacted the emergency services.
OL,19,FDespite the efforts of the emergency
OL,20,Fservices, the man died at the scene.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
