OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1784985492
OL,3,CThird person arrested after man
OL,4,Cstabbed to death in Stoke-on-Trent
OL,6,FHis next of kin have been informed and
OL,7,Fare being supported by specially-
OL,8,Ftrained officers.
OL,10,FA 24-year-old man, from Stoke-on-
OL,11,FTrent, has been arrested on suspicion
OL,12,Fof murder. He remains in custody for
OL,13,Fquestioning.
OL,15,FThe 25-year-old man, from Stoke-on-
OL,16,FTrent, and 17-year-old boy, from
OL,17,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, who were
OL,18,Farrested on Thursday (23 July) also
OL,19,Fremain in custody for questioning.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
