PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1784985492
OL,3,CThird person arrested after man
OL,4,Cstabbed to death in Stoke-on-Trent
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Ian
OL,7,FFitzgerald, from Staffordshire
OL,8,FPolice's major investigations
OL,9,Fdepartment, said: "We are working
OL,10,Ftirelessly to track down two other men
OL,11,Fwe believe are involved.
OL,13,F"I would urge anyone who thinks they
OL,14,Fhave information which could help us
OL,15,Fto get in touch.
OL,17,F"Thank you to everyone who has
OL,18,Fprovided us with footage and
OL,19,Finformation so far."
